# kin/youth/wear/robe_hang: the robe's skirt from the sash to the ankles: clean vertical folds (two lit, two in shadow),
# widening by a pixel each side below the knee, the lit hem band; the shoe tips (legs tips) show under it
# KIN-YOUTH (P2b wave 2). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Sway keys: rest (front and back: the bottom rows swing a pixel
# with the walk), wide (the side walk's contact and down: the hem opens front and back), flare (the run), kneel (the
# fall's buckle: two rows shorter, bunched), lie (lying: the left view draped).
# Motion fix round 3 (R3-06): the side (R, L) wide and flare keys (the side walk and run) end a row higher than rest, so
# the youth's thighs show under the hem (the tunic a lone hem row); the hang moves with the body on the down frames.
use person
body youth
role garment robe
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
sway 4

view D key rest origin 6 0
